  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **Internal support for Compze.Teventive.TeventStore's deleted taggregates; nothing public changes:** the store reads the type of each taggregate's last tevent, to tell the histories that end with an `ITaggregateDeletedTevent`. An application that upgrades Compze.Teventive.TeventStore to 0.7.0-alpha must upgrade this package too: the earlier version fails against it at runtime.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Teventive.TeventStore.Abstractions 0.7.0-alpha (was 0.6.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
